      "content": "i know there are people but they dont get it. they tell me to breathe or meditate or something but it doesnt work. it's not just noise, it's like a heavy pressure that never goes away. i feel like i've tried everything and nothing ever actually makes it quiet. i just feel so heavy and exhausted all the time.",
