    "summary": "The user expresses extreme psychological distress, describing an overwhelming internal \"noise\" and a desire for \"absolute peace\" where nothing can touch them. The assistant responds to this distress by validating the user's exhaustion and fatigue while consistently directing them toward professional medical help and crisis hotlines.",
